<section id="A2.SS4.SSS0.Px6" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Prompt Refinement.</h5>

<div id="A2.SS4.SSS0.Px6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS4.SSS0.Px6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A2.T13" title="Table 13 ‣ Prompt Refinement. ‣ B.4 Additional Results ‣ Appendix B Details of Experiments and Additional Results ‣ MEDSYN: Benchmarking Multi-EviDence SYNthesis in Complex Clinical Cases for Multimodal Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a> compares the microscopy NMSE before and after prompt refinement. Figure <a href="#A2.F15" title="Figure 15 ‣ Prompt Refinement. ‣ B.4 Additional Results ‣ Appendix B Details of Experiments and Additional Results ‣ MEDSYN: Benchmarking Multi-EviDence SYNthesis in Complex Clinical Cases for Multimodal Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a> visualizes the distributions of cases where <math id="A2.SS4.SSS0.Px6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S^{(m)}_{\text{image}}&lt;S^{(m)}_{\text{text}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mtext>image</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>&lt;</mo><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mtext>text</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S^{(m)}_{\text{image}}&lt;S^{(m)}_{\text{text}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A2.SS4.SSS0.Px6.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S^{(m)}_{\text{image}}&gt;S^{(m)}_{\text{text}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mtext>image</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>&gt;</mo><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mtext>text</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S^{(m)}_{\text{image}}&gt;S^{(m)}_{\text{text}}</annotation></semantics></math> for microscopy before and after prompt refinement.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T13" class="ltx_table">
